---
description: Frontend constants come from the generated src/constants.json
globs: src/**/*.js, src/**/*.jsx, src/**/*.ts, src/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

# Constants

- Enums, statuses, labels, limits and `PERMISSIONS` come from `src/constants.json`. Import them instead of redefining them.
- Never hand-edit `src/constants.json`: it's generated by `npm run fetch-constants`.
